#4201
The Forecastle~
   The raised deck at the bow, where the ship's bell hangs from a little
gallows and the anchor chains run out through their hawse holes.  The
figurehead below the bowsprit is a carved wren with its wings spread.
Spray comes over the bow when the sea is up.  The main deck is aft.
~
