#4205
The Galley~
   A cramped galley with an iron stove fenced in by a rail, so that the
pots don't fly off in a swell.  Strings of onions and dried fish hang
from the beams, and a barrel of ship's biscuit stands in the corner.  The
passenger cabin is forward.
~
