#4206
The Hold~
   The dark belly of the ship, below the waterline.  Bales and barrels are
stacked to the beams and roped in place, and bilge water sloshes over the
boards with every roll.  The timbers creak and groan like an old man
getting out of bed.  Something scurries away between the casks.  The
hatch is above.
~
